# Volkswagen Golf Mk3 five-door hatchback, 1991-1997.
#
# 4,020 mm long, 1,695 mm wide, 1,425 mm high, 2,470 mm wheelbase; 1.4-2.8
# petrol and 1.9 diesel.
# https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Volkswagen_Golf_Mk3
#
# Colours: Tornado Red, Alpine White, Diamond Silver and Black are period Golf
# colours.
#
# Weight: 340 in total (red 95, white 90, silver 85, black 70).
#
# Speed 180 km/h; comfort 105/340 (line). Classes 1,2.
# Dates: 1991-1997 with a road tail to about 2008.
#
# Metres master: citycars/4.5/vw-golf-mk3.blend. References:
# citycars/references/vw-golf-mk3/ (gitignored). Images via Wikimedia Commons.

